<article class="env-lemma" id="032M">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/032M">Lemma <span data-tag="032M">10.161.11</span>.</a> A Noetherian domain whose fraction field has characteristic zero is N-1 if and only if it is N-2 (i.e., Japanese). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from Lemma <a href="/tag/032L" data-tag="032L">10.161.8</a> since every field extension in characteristic zero is separable. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>